!Sample_label_protocol_ch1 = Biotin labeling was performed using the Ambion WT Expression Kit (Life Technologies, Grand Island, NY) according to the manufacturer's protocol, followed by the GeneChip WT Terminal Labeling and Controls Kit (Affymetrix, Santa Clara, CA).
!Sample_hyb_protocol = The labeled, fragmented DNA was hybridized to the Human Gene 2.0 ST Array (Affymetrix, Santa Clara, CA) for 18 hours in a GeneChip Hybridization oven 640 at 45oC with rotation (60 rpm).  The hybridized samples were washed and stained using an Affymetrix fluidics station 450.
!Sample_scan_protocol = After staining, microarrays were immediately scanned using an Affymetrix GeneArray Scanner 3000 7G Plus (Affymetrix, Santa Clara, CA).
!Sample_description = Gene expression data from SCC2 cells treated with siRNAs targeting both TAZ and YAP.
!Sample_data_processing = Raw Affymetrix CEL files were normalized to produce Entrez Gene-identifier-specific expression values using the implementation of the Robust Multiarray Average (RMA) in the affy Bioconductor package (version 1.36.1) and the Brainarray hugene20sthsentrezgcdf R package (version 16.0.0) (http://brainarray.mbni.med.umich.edu/Brainarray/Database/CustomCDF/16.0.0/entrezg.download/HuGene20st_Hs_ENTREZG_16.0.0.zip).
